Package: MBbioeq
Title: Model-Based Bioequivalence Analysis Using SAEM and TOST
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Eden", "BETE", email = "eden.bete.etu@univ-lille.fr", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Celia", "BENGUENNA", email = "celia.benguenna.etu@univ-lille.fr", role = c("aut")))
Description: Performs model-based bioequivalence analysis for parallel-arm studies 
    using Stochastic Approximation Expectation-Maximization (SAEM) estimation and 
    Two One-Sided Tests (TOST) procedure. Supports 1- and 2-compartment pharmacokinetic 
    models with optional absorption lag time. Implements Normal and Gallant corrections 
    for TOST, and delta-method for Cmax variance calculation. Allows flexible random 
    effects structures (diagonal, full, block) and multiple error models (additive, 
    proportional, combined).
